          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "10. Three objects 1, 2, and 3 of the same size and shape but made"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.091,
            0.641,
            0.167
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "of different materials are placed in the water. They dip to different depths as shown in Fig. 5.17. If the weights of the three objects 1, 2, and 3 are "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathsf { W } _ { 1 ^ { \\flat } } \\mathsf { W } _ { 2 ^ { \\flat } }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathbf { W } _ { 3 ^ { \\flat } }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " respectively, then"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.167,
            0.32,
            0.187
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(i) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "W_{1} = W_{2} = W_{3}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.188,
            0.319,
            0.209
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "W_{1} > W_{2} > W_{3}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 6,
